    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the highly sought-after Oaklawns development this substantial five-bedroom semi-detached residence presents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families, or investors seeking a property with enormous potential. Oaklawns is a well-established residential area conveniently located close to Dundalk town centre, schools, shops, sporting facilities and excellent transport links.\n\nExtending over generous accommodation the property comprises five well-proportioned bedrooms, two bathrooms, spacious living areas, and a practical layout ideal for modern family living. While the home would benefit from modernisation and decorative upgrading throughout, it offers purchasers the perfect blank canvas to create a home tailored to their own taste and style.\n\nThe property boasts a BER C rating providing a solid foundation for further enhancement.\n\nOutside the home benefits from a front garden and off-street parking with ample space for landscaping and improvement. The mature surroundings and family-friendly setting further enhance its appeal.\n\nKey Features:\n\nSpacious 5-bedroom semi-detached home\n2 bathrooms\nBER C rating\nExcellent residential location\nWalking distance to schools, shops, and local amenities\nIdeal project for first-time buyers or growing families\nHuge potential for modernisation and personalisation\nMature established neighbourhood\nOff-street parking and garden space\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a generously sized home in one of Dundalk`s most popular residential locations.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential on offer."
      },
